{"material_id": "ntce.zhongxue.jiaoyuzhishi.2012a.q30.material.recovered", "text": "学生张琼进入青春期后，非常关注自己的相貌。但她认为自己长相难看，不被人喜爱。看到同学聚在一起咯咯地笑，他就认为别人在笑话自己；在寝室里，若听到同学在谈论某某长得漂亮，会以为是在影射自己；上课未被老师点名发言，也会认为老师嫌自己难看不愿意点自己……所有这一切致使她郁郁寡欢，不愿意与同学沟通交流，学习效率低下，学习成绩明显下降。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2012年上半年教师资格证考试《教育知识与能力》（中学）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "1765f8782981fc9caa03f1fd48394f16c95f96432612e6519376bb59f6f04e87", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2186, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2349, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2012年上半年教师资格证考试《教育知识与能力》（中学）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 30, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "1765f8782981fc9caa03f1fd48394f16c95f96432612e6519376bb59f6f04e87"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.zhongxue.jiaoyuzhishi.2012a.q30"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.zhongxue.jiaoyuzhishi.m6.k01"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.zhongxue.ability.care"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.302.r032", "ntce.outline.302.r033", "ntce.outline.302.r047"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.zhongxue.jiaoyuzhishi.2012a.q30"], "word_count": 163, "level": "zhongxue", "subject": "jiaoyuzhishi", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2012年上半年教师资格证考试《教育知识与能力》（中学）真题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2012年上半年教师资格证考试《教育知识与能力》（中学）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "1765f8782981fc9caa03f1fd48394f16c95f96432612e6519376bb59f6f04e87", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2186, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2349, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2012年上半年教师资格证考试《教育知识与能力》（中学）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 30, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "1765f8782981